{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05157","headline":"奉和圣制送张说上集贤学士赐宴赋得莲字 · 赵冬曦","name":"奉和圣制送张说上集贤学士赐宴赋得莲字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"浅术方观海，深恩忽见天。\n学开丹殿籍，名与石渠贤。\n良辅膺休命，微生谬采甄。\n春余仍哢鸟，夏近未舒莲。\n牋札来宸禁，衣冠集诏筵。\n史臣知醉德，欲记升中年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵冬曦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05157.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05157","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}